    {
      "abstract": "$p_{\\rm T}$-dependence of the ratio between the $R_{\\rm PbPb}$ and the cold nuclear matter effects evaluated as $R_{\\rm pPb}$(-4.46 <y< -2.96) $\\times$  $R_{\\rm pPb}$(2.03 <y< 3.53).\nThe first uncertainty is statistical, the second one is the quadratic combination of $p_{\\rm T}$-uncorrelated and $p_{\\rm T}$-partially correlated systematic uncertainties, while the third is the $p_{\\rm T}$ correlated one.\n",
