  "data_abstract": "CERN-LHC.  Measurement of the rapidity and transverse-momentum dependence of the inclusive J/$\\psi$ production in p-Pb collisions at $\\sqrt{s_{\\rm NN}} = 5.02$ TeV at CERN LHC, in three center-of-mass rapidity ($y_{\\rm cms}$) regions, down to zero $p_{\\rm T}$. The measurements are performed at forward (2.03<$y_{\\rm cms}$<3.53), mid (-1.37<$y_{\\rm cms}$<0.43) and backward (-4.46<$y_{\\rm cms}$<-2.96) centre of mass rapidities.\n",
